{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure in procedural generated regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions in encounters and embrace the corresponding outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units on a chessboard-like battlefield and battle with all kinds of opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit legendary units, obtain rare artifacts, and learn powerful spells. Your strength will be defined by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One victory doesn't mean the end of the journey. There are still more gameplay and challenges to unlock.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 factions with different units, specialties and commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ unit cards, the vast majority of which can be recruited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ spells that can be learned and cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ items that can be obtained and equipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ random events, distributed in 4 different regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Early Access and will be continuously updated with more content added!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2723500/00ddc12e621a5de0e11f97c2680765cf9033a197.jpg"},{"name":"Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2723500/58d0702124d3582328770a7968c60d74124f2218.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2723500/deb9ac069c6965625168701befb0bb8769aeeff7.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2723500/8841671616c30db4cf4458b8f825